<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Conquest for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45624/emblem-of-conquest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></a> drop from the <b>10-man and 25-man</b> <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> bosses and can be exchanged for gear in <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4395/dalaran">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dalaran</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Your first <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45624/emblem-of-conquest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></a> should be saved up to buy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45633/breastplate-of-the-wayward-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_chain_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breastplate of the Wayward Protector</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45639/crown-of-the-wayward-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of the Wayward Protector</span></a> as early as possible if you aren't immediately fed T8 tokens, to beef up your survivability in preparation for hard modes. Both are BiS long term unlike the rest of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45624/emblem-of-conquest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_championsgrace.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Conquest</span></a> items for this phase. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45821/shard-of-the-crystal-forest">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_47.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shard of the Crystal Forest</span></a> is a decent upgrade to P1 necks, especially if you don't have <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44665/nexus-war-champion-beads">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nexus War Champion Beads</span></a> for progression, and overall good value per emblem.<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45825/shieldwarder-girdle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_48a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shieldwarder Girdle</span></a> also has a good upgrade per emblem value, but you may prefer the crafted <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=63191/indestructible-plate-girdle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_45a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Indestructible Plate Girdle</span></a> if you can afford it, that is basically on par with the phase BiS.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45834/gauntlets-of-the-royal-watch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gauntlets of the Royal Watch</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45842/wyrmguard-legplates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_07.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wyrmguard Legplates</span></a> are worse than the reasonably accessible T8 pieces in these slots, let alone ilvl 252 off-sets, and a poor upgrade per emblem value overall. I recommend against buying them, unless you're terribly unlucky with drops after a couple of months.<br/>
