<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 2</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-protection-warrior-tank-in-phase-2">Head for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 2</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45502/helm-of-the-faceless">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_138.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of the Faceless</span></a> is slightly better overall than the 25-man T8 <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46166/conquerors-siegebreaker-greathelm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_58.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Siegebreaker Greathelm</span></a> due to its superior strength and better secondary stats, but you will still want both eventually to unlock the option to swap to a <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64936">4p T8 bonus</a> set for magic heavy encounters.<br/>
<br/>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45935/ironbark-faceguard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_95.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ironbark Faceguard</span></a> is an excellent threat-oriented helmet thanks to its huge expertise, as long as you are below the hard cap (14%). Especially useful before you collect all these ilvl 252 items from hard modes that make up for most of the expertise in the final BiS set.<br/>
<br/>Alternatively, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46151/conquerors-siegebreaker-helmet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_58.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Siegebreaker Helmet</span></a> is also an interesting threat choice, albeit more extreme and arguably overkill. You will lose quite a lot of survivability and have to balance the missing defense elsewhere, but, if paired with the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46150">T8 Fury legs</a> in a threat-oriented set, this will let you unlock the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64938">2-pieces Fury set bonus</a> which grants an almost permanent <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64937">haste buff</a> for a tank.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50369/arcanum-of-the-stalwart-protector">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_swordandboard.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Stalwart Protector</span></a> (more defense), <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=67839/mind-amplification-dish">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mind Amplification Dish</span></a> (more stamina)<div class="pad"></div>
