<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-protection-warrior-tank-in-phase-2">Hands for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 2</h4>The <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45487/handguards-of-revitalization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_62.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Handguards of Revitalization</span></a> are one of the few ilvl 252 hard-mode items designed for tanks and therefore an instant BiS due to their superior item budget. These gloves specifically are miles ahead when it comes to mitigation score thanks to the perfect combination of secondary stats.<br/>In the meantime, the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46164/conquerors-siegebreaker-handguards">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Siegebreaker Handguards</span></a> are a decent pick to unlock the T8 set bonuses early, and with hit rating on top.<br/>
<br/>As a threat alternative, <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span>
<span class="q10">Horde</span> players, without <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=6562/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a> nor <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=20864/mace-specialization">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hammer_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mace Specialization</span></a>, can consider using the <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46148/conquerors-siegebreaker-gauntlets">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_28.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Siegebreaker Gauntlets</span></a> for additional hit and expertise if paired with the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46150">T8 Fury legs</a> in a threat-oriented set. The two items together will unlock the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64938">2-pieces Fury set bonus</a> which grants an almost permanent <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64937">haste buff</a> for a tank, but they also come with a significant loss in survivability and defense that will need to be compensated in other slots.<br/>
