<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-protection-warrior-tank-in-phase-2">Rings for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 2</h4>Once again, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45471/fates-clutch">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_69.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fate's Clutch</span></a> is the default BiS ring thanks to its superior ilvl 252 item budget and great secondary stats, doubling as the best threat and mitigation ring all at once.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45247/signet-of-the-earthshaker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_74.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of the Earthshaker</span></a> is the best second ring, at the middle point between the best ilvl 252 ring and the less desireable 232 alternative rings thanks to its high strength and block value.<br/>The other rings mentionned below are all in the same ballpark stat wise yet still decent upgrades over phase 1 rings while you wait for the perfect duo of rings.<br/>
