<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shields-for-protection-warrior-tank-in-phase-2">Shields for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 2</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45587/bulwark-of-algalon">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_67.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bulwark of Algalon</span></a> is the best P2 shield for overall value thanks to its higher total primary stats, especially strength. Nonetheless, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45877/the-boreal-guard">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_66.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Boreal Guard</span></a> is a strong contender with slightly more mitigation value from its superior stamina thanks to 2 gem sockets, and a precious ally for 25 man HM progression if you're lucky in the first couple 10 man clears.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45450/northern-barrier">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_66.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Northern Barrier</span></a> is also worth considering for a quick threat swap, coming with hit and expertise for consistency at the cost of roughly 10% mitigation compared to the aforementionned hard mode shields.<br/>
