<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="guns-and-bows-for-protection-warrior-tank-in-phase-2">Guns and Bows for Protection Warrior Tank in Phase 2</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45137/veranus-bane">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veranus' Bane</span></a> is the only ranged weapon with tank stats from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> and probably the only one that will replace your trusty <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41168/armor-plated-combat-shotgun">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_19.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armor Plated Combat Shotgun</span></a>. It's quite a good upgrade with ~25% more mitigation value and strength on top.<br/>
<br/>Technically speaking, a couple of the hard mode ilvl 245 and ilvl 252 ranged weapons would slot in between the engie gun and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45137/veranus-bane">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_rifle_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veranus' Bane</span></a>, but I don't want to get in trouble with the shooty boys over at the <a class="icontiny c3" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/hunter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_hunter.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hunter</span></a> discord so... Let's pretend they don't exist to avoid temptation. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Scope</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41167/heartseeker-scope">
